{"id":"f75c321d9cdbb404","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LReachBeta.md","title":"LReachBeta","display":"LReachBeta","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"LReachBeta","parameters":["d","t","u"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"LReachBeta"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>d</span><span>t</span><span>u</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：指标替换与规约。有序参数：<code>d</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ LReachBeta d t u)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Nat d)\n  (exists z1014\n    (exists z1015\n      (exists z1016\n        (and\n          (@ Seq z1014 z1015)\n          (and\n            (@ Num0 z1016)\n            (and\n              (@ App z1014 z1016 t)\n              (and\n                (@ Last z1014 u)\n                (and\n                  (forall z1017\n                    (implies\n                      (in z1017 z1015)\n                      (exists z1019 (and (@ App z1014 z1017 z1019) (and (@ URaw z1019) (@ Scoped d z1019))))))\n                  (forall z1017\n                    (implies\n                      (in z1017 z1015)\n                      (forall z1018\n                        (implies\n                          (and (@ Succ z1017 z1018) (in z1018 z1015))\n                          (exists z1019\n                            (exists z1020\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1014 z1017 z1019)\n                            (and (@ App z1014 z1018 z1020) (or (= z1019 z1020) (@ LStepBeta z1019 z1020)))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3febe648f9fc21a8\" href=\"?note=3febe648f9fc21a8\" title=\"ZFC_LStepBeta\">LStepBeta</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c005a1be0b2ad21f\" href=\"?note=c005a1be0b2ad21f\" title=\"ZFC_Scoped\">Scoped</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fad087c9d77463a6\" href=\"?note=fad087c9d77463a6\" title=\"ZFC_URaw\">URaw</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ LReachBeta d t u)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"